 p('The shipped output is LV: 32 EU at one amp per tick. The shipped input budget is four amps per tick, shared across faces. These are defaults; the effective settings below are authoritative for your server.'),
 p('A per-machine voltage or amperage override of zero inherits the global GT value. Battery charger/item tiers are separate from the cable settings. Refused over-voltage packets do not cause Calculator to explode. GT cables still apply their own cable losses.'),
